// Releases (DD-04 §4, DD-06 §4, delivery.md P21): a release operation
// certifies the exact saved source it names, registers the exact
// ReleaseSubject for review, waits for the maintainer's decision on that
// subject, publishes the npm and the browser/CSS target under their own
// effect identities, verifies both receipts and only then activates.
// Control keeps the committed projection the Workflow records and the API
// reads, and checks every binding it records: the subject digest over its
// fields, the certification it names (an accepted certified stage of the
